Recommends: kilix-95, ibus-gtk3, pulseaudio-utils, zenity, pavucontrol, orca
Description: Pleb, a Kilix desktop session
 Pleb is an X session whose desktop is one screen-filling Kilix window,
 managed by Openbox, with a screen locker, notifications, display settings,
 power, storage and Bluetooth helpers and a screen-capture portal backend.
 .
 This package adds "Pleb" to the display manager's session list. Each user's
 settings and state stay in their home.
